  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information has been Redacted in accordance with the two principled exceptions of the Foreign Aid Transparency and Accountability Act (FATAA) of 2016; including the health and security of implementing partners, as well as national interest of the United States.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity relates to Ukraine and strives to strengthen the global community&apos;s ability to safely destroy, store, apply safeguards to, and transport weapons of mass destruction (WMD) and secure related facilities and materials.</narrative>
  </description>
